[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0010","text":"——咦\n会长先生的店，要关门了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0000","text":"花店店主"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0020","text":"咦……\n难道说，你们都不知道？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0030","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0001","text":"花店店主"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0050","text":"啊，糟了\n这个可能不该说啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0002","text":"花店店主"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0060","text":"啊，不过一定……会长也会很高兴的\n因为放学后CLIMAX GIRLS的大家都这么努力呀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0070","text":"……这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0080","text":"大叔……为了会长先生和商店街的大家，\n我们一定要让活动办得开开心心的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0090","text":"——那，我们就先告辞了\n果穗、凛世，走吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0100","text":"好的……／好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0110","text":"——果穗，今天谢谢你了\n快进屋暖和暖和吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0120","text":"好的……那个，谢谢你送我回来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0130","text":"……嗯\n果穗……辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0133","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0134","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0135","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0140","text":"……凛世，你先回宿舍吧\n我……怎么说呢，还不想回去——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0150","text":"那么……凛世也……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0160","text":"…………这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0170","text":"…………你说，现在看到的这些景色，\n能记住多久呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0180","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0190","text":"……从这里看到的景色，还有我、大家，\n会不会在不知不觉中，一点一点地改变呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_03_0200","text":"……一定\n是这样的吧……"}]
